          <div class="govspeak"><p>The Freedom of Information Act requires us to tell members of the public how they can find information that is routinely made available. More information about this requirement can be found on the <a rel="external" href="https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/foi/publication-schemes-a-guide/">Information Commissioner’s Office website</a>.  We have formally adopted the model publication scheme.</p>

